I was awarded a tutor scholarship for the 'Astronomy for Educators' extension course, where I am teaching 37 astronomy overview classes from March to December 2026. My responsibilities include grading exams, activities, lesson plans, experiment reports, and field experience reports.

Material prepared for the class can be found [here](https://sites.google.com/view/estudos-de-astrofisica) (in portuguese).
